WEBVTT

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.610
Falulu?

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.100
Keep it together, Falulu!

00:00:25.340 --> 00:02:11.770
Falulu...

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.730
Our Lady Falulu!

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.190
Lady Falulu...

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:22.830
Falulu!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.660
I can administer CPR!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.150
No, we need a defibrillator!

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:28.680
Someone call an ambulance!

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.540
Someone get me that defibrillator!

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.000
It's no use.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:34.560
Pri?

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.620
Falulu's a Voca Doll.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:42.810
CPR or defibrillation will do no good.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:44.600
Neither will the ambulance.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:46.930
But, Unicorn...

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.130
Get away from her!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.500
You only bring misfortune!
It's your fault she ended up like this!

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.370
It's all over!

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:00.840
Get out of my sight!

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:01.900
Lady Falulu!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.120
What happened?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.410
Is she okay?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.250
Falulu...

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.720
This is why I stopped you.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:14.210
Why I told you you don't need friends...

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:19.240
I still wanted to be your friend...

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.650
But I knew I couldn't.

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:25.680
I knew this would happen!

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.310
We can't just stand here and watch!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.820
Well, yeah, but Unicorn isn't going to let us near her.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:37.710
I'm at a loss. I have no idea what any of this means.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.290
Seems we were late.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.540
What? Mr. Meganii?

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:42.820
Did you learn anything-pri?

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:49.110
Yes. We just finished analyzing the data on Falulu.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:51.960
And we've discovered something.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:57.710
Falulu must absolutely not snap her PriTicket.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:58.920
What?!

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:03.930
Yet she just did. And as a result...

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.850
Don't speak in riddles! What exactly are you saying?

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:11.700
Let me start from the beginning.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.860
Meganii Hologrammation!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.020
Whoa, that's amazing!

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.040
Definitely amazing.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:34.000
Now, let us begin.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.300
I'm sure you're all aware by now.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:44.630
"Yes, I am the Vocal Doll, born from a PriTicket, Falulu."

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:47.310
"Your imagination gave birth to me."

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:48.220
Meganii...

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:51.180
Our imagination-pri?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.110
Yes.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:03.990
I too... Want to become an idol!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.950
Idols are so cool!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.910
So cute!

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.360
I really want to be an idol...

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.800
I want to be an idol.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:15.830
Me too!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:16.530
So lovely!

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:17.310
So cute!

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.940
I want to be an idol!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:20.390
I'll become an idol!

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.290
Me too!

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:21.750
And me!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:22.890
Me too!

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.240
As do I!

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.340
A lovely idol!

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:29.020
A shining idol!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.070
An exciting idol!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:34.070
A Divine Idol!

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:43.080
All these powerful feelings coalesced, giving birth to Falulu.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.120
A miracle of imagination.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.200
Hm? A PriTicket?

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:56.620
This is a...

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:21.020
With Unicorn's help, Falulu immediately began focusing on become a top idol.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.320
And her progress was prodigious indeed.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.270
Her fanbase grew and her rank increased steadily.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:31.820
However...

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.440
She began to gain self-awareness.

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.160
Self-awareness?

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.450
The ability to be conscious of your own identity.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:45.470
Consciousness? Like... a soul?

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.880
Indeed, you could say a soul was born within her.

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:52.600
And meeting you was what caused that, Lala.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:54.560
Me?

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:59.980
Your presence within Falulu's mind grew larger, and led to great change.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:06.390
For the first time, she took interest in something other than becoming a Divine Idol.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:13.780
She came to think that she wanted not just fans, but friends.

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:21.580
And that led her snapping the PriTicket, though she was never meant to.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:25.040
She did something that should have been impossible for her.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:30.010
If we consider the mind a computer program, the "soul" that awakened within her would be called...

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.970
a bug.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:33.580
A bug?

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.090
An error. A mistake.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:44.650
Much as a program might freeze upon encountering one, Falulu herself has stopped functioning.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.360
Indeed.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:57.240
Falulu may well have been aware this would happen.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:01.330
Aware that she must not snap her ticket. And yet...

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.580
I always thought this might happen.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:15.170
But... That means if she snapped tickets with a friend...

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:19.190
She was destined to die if she ever made a friend?

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.220
What the heck?!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.140
That's...

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.100
Terrible!

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:27.540
This is why I told her she has no need of friends!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.890
Things like affection weren't meant for her!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.070
It could only hurt her!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:35.130
However much I loved her...

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:37.490
I knew I had to hide it.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:45.000
I could never be more than just a manager to her.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.620
But she still wanted to be friends...

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:53.420
Falulu...

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:58.260
Oh no, this is my fault...

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.140
I was the one who made Falulu...

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:03.670
Non, non. You are mistaken.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.810
Mr. Meganii...

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.800
Falulu herself wanted this.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:10.760
She wanted to be your friend.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.820
My friend...

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.170
Mr. Meganii!

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:20.160
Please tell me! Is Falulu going to stay like that?

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.950
How can we make her move again?

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.960
What do we do to wake her up?

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.920
That... is beyond even my knowledge.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:32.840
Ms. Meganee!

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:36.090
I'm sorry. I don't know either.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.290
No way...

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.870
What are we supposed to do?

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:53.400
Can't you calculate our way out of this?

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.190
I can't make heads or tails of these numbers.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.390
What about you, Shion?

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:03.090
Falulu... When I first met her...

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.160
She said it was sparkly.

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:11.170
She said my Prism Voice was sparkly, and that she liked it.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.230
Prism Voice, huh?

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.840
dfs

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.040
Got it-pri!
I see it!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:21.690
What?

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.310
The Prism Voice-pri!
The Prism Voice!

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:28.190
Prism Voice what? What?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.650
You blockhead!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.110
Whaaat?

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.820
Lala has a Prism Voice, right-pri?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:35.970
Yeah-kuma!

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:39.810
Any mascot worth their salt can recognize a Prism Voice-usa.

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:42.280
And Lala and Falulu have been the only ones with it lately-kuma!

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:44.740
And the Prism Voice has mysterious powers, right?

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.000
Kuma!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.170
I've heard it's supposed to reach the listener's very heart and soul.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.920
Falulu's heart and soul! This is it!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:56.760
And its power will be strongest on stage!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:57.760
Pri!

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:00.720
Power...

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.220
<i>I always just felt self-conscious for being too loud...</i>

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:07.510
<i>But being on stage made me realize there's nothing wrong with that.</i>

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:10.850
<i>I made new friends.</i>

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:15.360
<i>And sometimes it led to arguments, but that just made our friendship stronger.</i>

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.650
<i>And we could inspire others to be brave too.</i>

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:22.130
<i>I even teamed up with someone I'd always admired.</i>

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:23.360
<i>Real miracles have happened!</i>

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.040
PriPara,

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.950
the Prism Voice,

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.160
and being on stage!

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.480
Those are all powerful things!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:34.380
We might just be able to bring Falulu back!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.800
Yeah!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:41.220
We'll give you all the miracles you need!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.780
This might very well work.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:49.950
You're not cold, are you, Falulu?

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.990
You'll wake up like always, won't you?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.040
Falulu...

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:05.820
I've got a whole mountain of things I couldn't say...

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:10.470
I didn't have the time to really tell you anything.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.070
How glad I was to have met you...

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.870
How much I love you...

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:18.740
How grateful I am...

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.630
Unicorn!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:51.450
Unicorn! We might be able to wake Falulu up!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.750
What?

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.460
With the power of a Prism Voice.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.420
Prism Voice... You mean yours?

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.750
Miracles...

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:01.760
Aren't out of reach-pri!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.300
Actions speak louder than words!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.650
Tension Max!

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:05.760
Relax!

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.480
It's pointless!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:12.500
Mascots can recognize a Prism Voice.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:15.210
Lala's Prism Voice...

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:17.490
is a million years too early for that.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.980
But...

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.860
Quit daydreaming!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.120
I almost had hope for a second there!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.600
Get out of here!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.950
Capiiisce!

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.080
Falulu...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.500
What now-pri?

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.210
Well, she's right in that we don't really know if it'd work-usa.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:39.920
We so do!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.440
I won't give up.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.760
There's nothing else I can do!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.890
Unicorn said I'm not ready yet.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.240
I'll just have to work harder.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:54.600
To control the Prism Voice better.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:57.560
So I can shine brighter on stage!

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:58.980
Yeah!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:04.230
I'll do my best! Do my capisce!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.570
I'm home!

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:12.410
See you later!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:18.610
<i>I have to work harder to wake Falulu up!</i>

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.760
Falulu, wake up! It's morning!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.220
Pri!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:29.280
<i>We're all powering up.</i>

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.440
<i>We can't slow Lala down</i>

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:33.180
<i>We've gotta work harder too-pri!</i>

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:38.520
Awaken! The night came, but so must the morning!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.240
Night and day!

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.610
Not enough!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.020
R-Right...

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:47.300
Chant harder!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.570
Yes ma'am!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:49.400
Go!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.080
Yay!

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.240
<i>We'll have to shine way brighter!</i>

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.210
<i>Give it all we've got!</i>

00:14:56.210 --> 00:15:01.420
<i>Daily training! Just as in go, we must sharpen our instincts and perfect our technique.</i>

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.300
Bring it-chanko!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.800
You have to stomp harder!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:12.180
The stomps in sumo are meant drive the evil spirits of the land out!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.390
Bring it-chanko!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.170
76,403!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.680
Cold!

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:26.780
76,404!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:32.280
<i>More, more, I have to get better!</i>

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:38.280
I'll just glue it back on.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.750
She sells sea-shells on the sea-shore!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.540
Clean clams crammed in clean cans!

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.400
Lala...

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:51.000
Sorry, am I being too noisy?

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:51.930
No.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.030
I'm really worried about Falulu...

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:59.470
I don't usually trust you with stuff,

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.350
but good luck!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:01.660
Non...

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.810
Capisce!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:09.130
She sells seashells by the seashore.

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:12.740
Kitty caught the kitten in the kitchen.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:16.700
PriPara Parajuku papipupepo.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.450
Imagine an imaginary menagerie manager.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.040
Go!

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:27.340
Eleven owls licked eleven little liquorice lollipops.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:31.760
Many an anemone sees an enemy anemone.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.920
It's not sticking at all.

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:39.000
I can't even glue a PriTicket back together...

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:42.460
I'm useless...

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:47.950
I'm nothing but a beautiful and lovely and cute Unicorn!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.390
Falulu...

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:53.510
Sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.200
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.440
Coord Change Start!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.240
It's Lala's big solo performance today!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:14.500
And the extra-frilly Idol Coord will help her achieve all the stage presence she needs.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.090
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.520
<i>I can do this. For Falulu!</i>

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.640
You can do it!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:25.810
For Falulu!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.780
I want to wake Falulu back up.

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:35.240
That's why I'll work harder than ever!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.720
<i>Love Friend Style</i>, Lala's solo version.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.680
<i>Falulu... Can you hear my voice?</i>

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.490
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:22.680
<i>If you can't, I'll sing even harder!</i>

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.720
<i>Even louder!</i>

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.610
<i>So everyone all over the world hears.</i>

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:32.060
<i>I know, I know, for sure,</i>

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:36.200
<i>that we'll meet again, Falulu!</i>

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:43.510
Cyalume Change!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.800
Falulu! Listen to my song!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.080
Lala!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.290
That was huge!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.380
That was good!

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:34.250
Lala! Good going-pri!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.470
Good job!

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:36.210
Chanko!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.130
Well done!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.590
How was that? Is her Prism Voice there?

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.240
It's pretty good-kuma...

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:45.790
Usa...

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:46.980
All right-pri!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:48.560
This might just work!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.190
Lala! That was great-pri!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.480
I've never seen anything like it.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:01.980
Okay! Let's do it! The ultimate performance, with everyone at peak performance!

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:04.520
Let's go! To the stage!

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:07.860
These numbers are way beyond calculating, but I think it'll work!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.610
We'll wear the paradise coord...

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.660
We can use that to revive Falulu.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.370
Guys... Yeah! Let's do it!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:21.340
Hip, hip, capisce!

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.800
Capisce!

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:30.110
That was... No good at all.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.570
Falulu...

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:10.600
